### Part B — AI Search Citation Check

#### Step 5 — Read priority query list

Top 10 queries to test (read from `brain/AI-PRIORITY-QUERIES.md`; if missing, seed with):

```markdown
# AI Citation Priority Queries (top 10)

Mental-health informational:
1. best mental health platform india
2. online therapy bangalore
3. psychiatrist near me bangalore
4. cbt therapy online india
5. anxiety treatment india

Branded discovery:
6. mindtalk cadabams
7. cadabams mental health
8. cadabams app

Condition-led:
9. depression treatment online india
10. ocd specialist bangalore

(Add/remove via 7-day Meta-Learner preview proposal.)
```

#### Step 6 — Query each AI search engine via Claude in Chrome

For each query, use the `mcp__Claude_in_Chrome__*` toolkit to:

1. Open `https://www.perplexity.ai`
2. Enter query
3. Wait for response
4. Read the response + check if `mindtalk.in` appears in the cited sources
5. Read top 3 cited sources (note which competitors got citations Mindtalk didn't)

Repeat for:
- `https://chat.openai.com` — query, then check if Mindtalk appears in response text OR in any "Sources" panel
- `https://claude.ai` — same
- `https://www.google.com/search?q={query}` — check AI Overview presence + cited sources

Authentication: assumes the Mac Mini browser already has Kushal logged into ChatGPT and Claude. If logout, post Slack flag and skip those two (Perplexity + Google work without login).

#### Step 7 — Tabulate results

```
| Query | Perplexity | ChatGPT | Claude | Google AI Overview |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| best mental health platform india | ❌ not cited | ❌ | ❌ | 🟢 cited 1 of 5 |
| online therapy bangalore | ❌ | 🟢 cited in response | ❌ | ❌ no AI OV shown |
| ...
```

Compare to last week's snapshot in `brain/memory/ai-citations-{LAST_WEEK}.md`. Flag:
- Citations LOST (was cited, now not) — investigate page changes
- Citations GAINED (wasn't cited, now is) — record what's working
- AI Overview newly appeared for a query — opportunity to optimize for the snippet

